1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,353
The readings in your tables, drawn on the chart, on the candles where they happened.

2
00:00:04,791 --> 00:00:07,971
We're on Bitcoin, with daily candles over the last year.

3
00:00:08,421 --> 00:00:10,473
Sonar adds a strip under the price:

4
00:00:10,493 --> 00:00:15,292
momentum waves, money flow, and big dots where momentum turns at an extreme.

5
00:00:17,447 --> 00:00:20,798
Sonar markers put the signals on the candles themselves.

6
00:00:20,848 --> 00:00:24,774
Pick which ones to show in this row, and point at one to see what it means.

7
00:00:27,449 --> 00:00:31,237
Chart shapes outlines head and shoulders, double tops and double bottoms,

8
00:00:31,257 --> 00:00:33,488
with the neckline and a rough target.

9
00:00:33,538 --> 00:00:36,739
Gold and grey stars mark golden and death crosses.

10
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:43,759
Show a Signal Set on the chart.

11
00:00:43,809 --> 00:00:47,001
Every day is coloured by the Set's answer at that day's close:

12
00:00:47,021 --> 00:00:49,186
green where its conditions were met.

13
00:00:54,137 --> 00:00:59,920
Dashed lines mark the big US releases: Fed decisions, inflation and jobs reports.

14
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:02,531
The next ones are drawn ahead of the last candle.

15
00:01:06,074 --> 00:01:08,443
Turn any of them off with the same pills.

16
00:01:08,493 --> 00:01:10,607
Your choices stay with your account.
